(   analytical equipment".) Tj
T*
(   - Hardware / Software: Strictly uncountable. Never write *hardwares or *softwares.) Tj
T*
(   - Information / Knowledge: Mass nouns requiring partitive counters like "items of information".) Tj
T*
(   - Media vs. Medium: 'Culture medium' is singular; 'culture media' is plural.) Tj
T*
(   - Bacteria vs. Bacterium: 'Bacterium' is singular; 'bacteria' is plural.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Exemplary Scientific Corrections:) Tj
T*
(   - Incorrect: "The lab ordered five new equipments and hardwares for genomic sequencing.") Tj
T*
(   - Correct: "The laboratory procured five new pieces of equipment and computational hardware for) Tj
T*
(   genomic sequencing.") Tj
T*
(   - Incorrect: "Different culture mediums was prepared for fungal sporulation.") Tj
T*
(   - Correct: "Different culture media were prepared for fungal sporulation.") Tj
T*
(   - Incorrect: "The data shows that this phenomenons is reproducible.") Tj
T*
(   - Correct: "The data show that this phenomenon is reproducible.") Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
